25. Случайные величины X и Y независимы и имеют нормальное распределение, $EE(X) = 0, "Var"(X) = 1, E(Y) = 2, "Var"(Y) = 6$. Найдите $P(1 < X + 2Y < 7)$.

$
  X space bot space Y ~ N, quad X ~ N (0,1) , Y ~ N(2, 6), S = X + 2Y \
  X space bot space Y => EE(S) = a EE(X) + b EE(Y), quad "Var"(X) = a^2 "Var"(X) + b^2 "Var"(Y) \
  EE(S) = 1 dot 0 + 2 dot 2 = 4, quad "Var"(S) = 1^2 dot 1 + 2^2 dot 6 = 25 => mu = 4, sigma = sqrt(25) = 5 \ 
  S ~ N(4, 25), quad "Standartization" ->  Z = (X - mu)/sigma ~ N(0,1) \ 
  P(1 < S < 7) = P((1 - 4)/5 < S< (7-4)/5) = \ Phi(3/5 ) - Phi(-3/5) = Phi(3/5) - (1 - Phi(3/5)) = 2 Phi(0.6) - 1 = 2 dot 0.7257 - 1 = 0.4514
$

$
  triangle
$


26. Случайные величины X и Y независимы и имеют нормальное распределение, $EE(X) = 0, "Var"(X) = 1, E(Y) = 3, "Var"(Y) = 7$. Найдите $P(1 < 3X + Y < 7)$.

$
  X bot Y ~ N, X ~ N(0,1), Y ~ N(3, 7), S = 3X + Y \
  X bot Y => EE(S) = a EE(X) + b EE(Y), quad "Var"(S) = a^2 "Var"(X) + b^2 "Var"(Y), space "cov"(X,Y ) = 0 \
  EE(S) = 3 dot 0 + 1 dot 3 = 3 , quad "Var"(X) = 3^2 dot 1 + 1^2 dot 7 =  16 => mu = 3, sigma = sqrt(16) = 4 \ 
  S ~ N(3,4), quad "Standartization" => Z = (X-mu)/sigma ~ N(0,1) \ 
  P(1 < S < 7) = P( (1 - 3)/4 < S < (7 - 3)/4) = P(-0.5 < S < 1) \
   Phi(1) - Phi(-0.5) = Phi(1) - (1 -  Phi(0.5)) = 0.8413−0.3085=0.5328
$

$
  triangle
$

